This is the Void. It exists outside time and space. It is a manifestation of 
the digital space between the engine which drives reality and reality itself.
It therefore carries some properties of a room and some properties which defy
the definition of a room. Which properties hold fast remain to be seen. This
room also serves as a staging area for people and things ready to be 
implemented but which also must undergo a last phase of testing prior to being 
released into the wild. If you have found yourself here, it is by some mistake
of divine oversight, and your stay should not be longer than it must be. The
only way out of this room is through divine teleportation, so it is suggested
that any inhabitants of this room contact a divine as soon as possible.
